</div>
</section>

<!-- PRICE TREND -->
<section class="section">
<div class="container">
  <div class="section-label">02 · Long-Term Price Trend Analysis</div>
  <div class="section-title">Closing Price History & Market Phases (2000–2026)</div>
  <div class="section-desc">Monthly adjusted closing prices across 26 years. Nike's trajectory spans four distinct structural phases — each shaped by macroeconomic cycles, competitive dynamics, and company-specific catalysts.</div>

  <div class="chart-wrapper">
    <div class="chart-title">NKE Adjusted Closing Price — Monthly (2000–2026)</div>
